# Per-Dockerfile ignore for `docker build -f mayhem/Dockerfile .` (netnew §4b).
#
# BuildKit gives this file FULL PRECEDENCE over the repo-root .dockerignore when
# the build uses -f mayhem/Dockerfile. Fabric's root .dockerignore excludes
# `.git/objects/pack`, `**/*_test.go` and `.github` — the first of which would
# strip the git history the grader/PATCH tier require from the COPYed /mayhem tree.
#
# This file deliberately excludes (almost) nothing so the commit image keeps the
# full .git history and every source file build.sh needs. Only local build scratch
# is dropped.
mayhem-build/
_mayhem_harness/
